WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.720
Hello, my name
is Hassan Munene.

00:02.720 --> 00:05.893
I'm a software
engineer at Shamba Records,

00:05.893 --> 00:08.522
and today I took
a trip to the field

00:08.522 --> 00:10.490
to talk with one
of our farmers that

00:10.490 --> 00:12.163
we have been
supporting since 2024,

00:12.163 --> 00:15.703
and see how the
progress has been and

00:15.703 --> 00:19.500
how our financial services
can be helping him.
